  "description": "Each participant is randomly assigned to one of five urban green space scenes. The four versions of that scene (four design intensities made in Photoshop) are shown together for 15 s, then ranked by preference (1–4), and then each version is rated alone on a four-item restorative potential scale (being away, extent, fascination, compatibility; 1–7). Rebuilt from Wu, Zhuo, Liu, Yu, Huang & Liu (2021), IJERPH 18(20): 10944, with the 20 photos from the paper's Figure 1 (CC BY 4.0).",
